  "gotchas": [
    "HadithTheme::parent()/children() reference parent_id — column absent in MySQL (1054). sqlite tests won't catch it.",
    "Hadith has no hasMany for sources/keywords/relatedVerses/applications/fiqhRulings — only the inverse belongsTo exists.",
    "hadith_grading_levels is NOT a lookup table in practice: 566 rows, 444 of them used exactly once. Raw grade strings became levels, e.g. 'sahih_(darussalam)_[bukhari_3615_and_muslim_2009]' (a citation) and 'hasan_(darussalam)]' (unbalanced bracket). Only ~5 are real grades.",
    "hadith_grading_levels.grade_ar holds ENGLISH text (537/566 rows are pure ASCII: 'Sahih', 'A Hasan hadeeth'). The Arabic grade column was never populated.",
    "grading coverage: 21,530 of 51,436 hadiths have >=1 row in hadith_gradings (42%); 4,388 hadiths have NULL grading_status.",
    "hadith_hadiths.grading_status is an unnormalized varchar(512) duplicating hadith_gradings; variants include Sahih / Sahih / صَحِيح / صَحِيحٌ and Da'if vs Da’if (curly apostrophe = distinct value).",
    "gradings attribute 9,379 rows to 'Imam al-Bukhari' and 8,863 to 'Imam Muslim' — inclusion in a sahih collection is provenance, not a rijal grading. Modeling error.",
    "All three *_translations side tables are genuinely empty (0 rows) while spatie JSON columns carry the data.",
    "hadith_hadiths carries no text column — always join hadith_translations (is_primary / language_code).",
